<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When all are sweetly joined</l><l>(True followers of the Lamb),</l><l>They’re one in heart and mind,</l><l>They think and speak the same;</l><l>When all in love together dwell;</l><l>The comfort is unspeakable!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Where unity takes place,</l><l>The joys of heav’n we prove;</l><l>This is the gospel grace,</l><l>The unction from above;</l><l>The Spirit on all saints is shed,</l><l>Descending swift from Christ the Head.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Where unity is found,</l><l>The sweet anointing grace</l><l>Extends to all around,</l><l>And shines from every face;</l><l>To every praising saint it comes,</l><l>And fills him with divine perfumes.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>On all His chosen ones</l><l>The precious oil comes down:</l><l>Anointing as it runs,</l><l>Anointing on and on.</l><l>E’en to His skirts (the meanest name</l><l>That longs to love the bleeding Lamb).</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
